{"seq":3,"slug":"right-sizing-the-spec","title":"规格的粒度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/spec-driven-development-with-ai/writing-good-specs/right-sizing-the-spec","wordCount":1837,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"规格的粒度\">规格的粒度</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>规格驱动最危险的误读，是把它当成「写厚重需求文档」的复兴。Spec Kit 的 README 自己就回顾了这段历史：<em>&quot;For decades, code has been king — specifications were just scaffolding we built and discarded once the &#39;real work&#39; of coding began&quot;</em>（<a href=\"https://github.com/github/spec-kit\">Spec Kit</a>）——大而全的规格文档在软件史上反复出现又反复腐烂，原因从来不是格式不对，而是维护成本跑赢了它带来的收益。规格驱动的正确姿势恰好相反：<strong>只规格这次要动的那一块，写到刚好够 AI 不跑偏、人能验收为止</strong>。本文讨论粒度的两个失败方向、业界现成的粒度谱系，以及按风险选粒度的可操作方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>只规格要动的那一块</strong>：规格的存在理由是指导一次具体改动，不是充当系统全量文档。</li>\n<li><strong>两个失败方向</strong>：过大——维护成本跑赢收益，很快与代码脱节变成摆设；过小——关键行为与边界没说清，退回靠先验猜的生成。</li>\n<li><strong>最优点远小于「完备」</strong>：防跑偏收益随体量边际递减，维护成本随体量超线性增长，两线相切处即最优粒度。</li>\n<li><strong>粒度是函数而非常数</strong>：两个输入是改动风险与方案清晰度，组合出微型规格、完整规格、粗规格三档。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下面按「为什么只需一块 → 两个失败方向 → 业界谱系 → 怎么选」的顺序展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"只规格这次要动的那一块\">只规格这次要动的那一块</h2><p>规格的存在理由是指导一次具体改动，不是充当系统的全量文档。把整个系统每个角落都规格化既不可能（工作量爆炸）也无意义（大部分角落这次根本不会动）。主流工具在机制层面就内置了这种范围控制：Spec Kit 把项目级原则抽到一次性的 constitution 里，每个功能只写自己的 specify/plan/tasks；AWS Kiro 的每个 spec 对应一个 feature 或 bugfix，工件落在 <code>.kiro/specs/&lt;name&gt;/</code> 目录下、随该功能存续（<a href=\"https://kiro.dev/docs/specs/\">Kiro Specs</a>）；Claude Code 的 plan mode 天然 scoped 到当前任务——计划针对眼前要改的代码生成，批准即执行。</p>\n<p>范围聚焦还有一层审查红利：小规格意味着评审者可以在几分钟内通读并发现漏洞，而几百页的需求文档在实践中得到的待遇是没人读完、更没人逐条核对——过大的规格等于没有规格。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过大与过小都是失败模式\">过大与过小都是失败模式</h2><p>两个方向各有一条通往失败的路径。过大时：写起来耗时、读起来劝退、且因为体积太大很快与代码脱节变成摆设；更隐蔽的是，在还没想清楚时就把一切定死，会扼杀必要的探索——不是所有决定都该提前做出。过小时：关键行为、边界与约束没说清，AI 退回靠先验猜的状态，规格驱动退化成普通 vibe coding；缺了可检验的验收标准，「完成」也没有客观答案。两个方向尽头殊途同归：过大养不起同步、终将漂移（对策见<a href=\"../specs-in-practice/living-specs-and-drift\">活规格与防漂移</a>），过小则退化回靠猜的生成。</p>\n<p>可以用一个直觉模型概括这对矛盾。设规格体量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，防跑偏收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随体量增长但边际递减，维护成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随体量超线性增长（每处规格都要与代码保持同步），则总代价为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mtext> 满足 </mtext><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfrac><msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfrac><msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">∣</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(s) = C(s) - B(s), \\qquad s^* \\text{ 满足 } \\frac{dB}{ds}\\Big|_{s^*} = \\frac{dC}{ds}\\Big|_{s^*}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0712em;vertical-align:-0.6997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">满足</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1800\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v600 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-600 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v600 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.65em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.2669em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.0003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6183em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0712em;vertical-align:-0.6997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.15em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.8em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.8em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1800\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v600 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-600 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v600 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.65em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:-0.2669em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.0003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6183em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 超线性增长而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 边际递减，最优点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>s</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必然远小于「完备」对应的体量——这解释了为什么所有认真实践规格驱动的工具都停在轻量端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"业界的粒度谱系\">业界的粒度谱系</h2><p>轻量规格并非新发明，从架构决策记录到 IETF 文档，工程界早已形成一套按对象分层的短文档传统：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>载体</th>\n<th>典型规模</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n<th>适合的对象</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ADR（Nygard, 2011）</td>\n<td>一页以内，context / decision / consequences 三段</td>\n<td>记录后基本不改</td>\n<td>单个架构决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RFC / IETF 文档</td>\n<td>聚焦单一主题</td>\n<td>发布后冻结，由后续 RFC 修订</td>\n<td>协议与接口变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kiro spec</td>\n<td>requirements + design + tasks 三个 md</td>\n<td>随 feature/bugfix 存续</td>\n<td>一个功能或缺陷修复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spec Kit 系列</td>\n<td>constitution 一次性 + per-feature 工件组</td>\n<td>implement/converge 循环内活跃</td>\n<td>一个功能的完整交付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本仓库 <code>.agents/plans</code></td>\n<td>单个 md + status frontmatter</td>\n<td>draft → active → done 流转归档</td>\n<td>一次任务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ADR 值得多说一句：Michael Nygard 在 <em>Documenting Architecture Decisions</em> 中主张每个重要决策一份短文档，写清背景、决策与后果（<a href=\"http://thinkrelevance.com/blog/2011/11/15/documenting-architecture-decisions\">原文</a>）——它的轻量性正是这套方法被广泛采用的原因。本仓库自身的实践同构：<code>.agents/plans/</code> 下每份计划用 frontmatter <code>status:</code> 字段作为唯一权威状态源，子目录只是派生视图，任务完成后经 CLI 归档进 <code>done/</code>——规格随任务而生、完成即归档或沉淀，而不是堆在活分支里慢慢过期。</p>\n<p>Kiro 还示范了同一工具内的双粒度：完整的 gated workflow 分 Requirements-First 与 Design-First 两档逐步审批，而对理解充分的功能提供 Quick Spec 一键生成全部三个工件、免审批门（<a href=\"https://kiro.dev/docs/specs/\">Kiro Specs</a>）——工具层已经承认：不同成熟度的改动值得不同重量的流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"按风险与清晰度选粒度\">按风险与清晰度选粒度</h2><p>粒度选择的两个输入是改动风险（难回滚？影响面大？碰核心逻辑？）与方案清晰度（关键路径想清楚了吗），组合成三档：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A{&quot;改动风险高?&lt;br/&gt;难回滚 / 影响面大&quot;} -- &quot;否&quot; --&gt; B[&quot;微型规格&lt;br/&gt;PR 描述内一两句意图 + 一条验收&quot;]&#10;    A -- &quot;是&quot; --&gt; C{&quot;关键路径想清楚了?&quot;}&#10;    C -- &quot;是&quot; --&gt; D[&quot;完整规格&lt;br/&gt;意图 + EARS 行为 + 编号验收&quot;]&#10;    C -- &quot;否&quot; --&gt; E[&quot;粗规格&lt;br/&gt;方向 + 已知边界, 边做边细化&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; F[&quot;实现 → 核对循环&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n    A{\"改动风险高?&lt;br/&gt;难回滚 / 影响面大\"} -- \"否\" --&gt; B[\"微型规格&lt;br/&gt;PR 描述内一两句意图 + 一条验收\"]\n    A -- \"是\" --&gt; C{\"关键路径想清楚了?\"}\n    C -- \"是\" --&gt; D[\"完整规格&lt;br/&gt;意图 + EARS 行为 + 编号验收\"]\n    C -- \"否\" --&gt; E[\"粗规格&lt;br/&gt;方向 + 已知边界, 边做边细化\"]\n    B --&gt; F[\"实现 → 核对循环\"]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F</pre><p>粗规格一档值得强调：Spec Kit 的 converge 循环本身就是迭代机制——实现与规格不符时逐条修正直至 <strong>Converged</strong>（<a href=\"https://github.com/github/spec-kit\">Spec Kit</a>），这意味着「先给方向、边做边细化」不需要额外的流程支持，规格可以随理解的推进分次补全，而不必一次到位。而当风险低到连微型规格都多余，「不写」也是受控选项——判断不等式见<a href=\"../specs-in-practice/when-not-to-spec\">何时不必写规格</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>用 TTL 思维对待规格</strong>：任务完成立即归档或删除活跃分支上的规格文件，留着的每一份都在悄悄过期。</li>\n<li><strong>简单改动的规格写在 PR 描述里</strong>：不必为它单开文件，两句话加一条判据就是微型规格的全部。</li>\n<li><strong>代码与规格冲突时当场修规格</strong>：否则这份规格从冲突那一刻起就在制造错误信息。</li>\n<li><strong>定期清点活跃规格数量</strong>：超过团队并行处理能力说明积压，积压的规格比没有规格更糟——它会诱导人引用已过时的约束。</li>\n<li><strong>升级路径预先想好</strong>：粗规格执行中若发现风险陡增，停下来补全为完整规格再继续，别让惯性推着粗规格做完高风险改动。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>粒度问题的答案是函数而非常数：以风险定详尽、以清晰度定先后、以防跑偏与可验收为下限、以维护成本为上限。规格的价值在轻量聚焦，一旦开始追求完备，它就会重演历史上那些没人读的大文档的命运。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"规格的粒度","id":"规格的粒度"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"只规格这次要动的那一块","id":"只规格这次要动的那一块"},{"level":2,"text":"过大与过小都是失败模式","id":"过大与过小都是失败模式"},{"level":2,"text":"业界的粒度谱系","id":"业界的粒度谱系"},{"level":2,"text":"按风险与清晰度选粒度","id":"按风险与清晰度选粒度"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"验收标准与示例","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/spec-driven-development-with-ai/writing-good-specs/acceptance-criteria-and-examples"},"next":{"title":"先定规格再生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/spec-driven-development-with-ai/spec-driven-workflow/spec-then-generate"}}